    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38902" root="ملد" body-key="m">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلِدَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدَ</span></b> ,] (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدٌ</span> (K, TA)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدَانٌ</span>, (M,) <i>It</i> (a branch, M, TA) <i>was, or
became, soft, tender,</i> or <i>delicate;</i> (M, K;) <i>and
quivered, shook,</i> or <i>played loosely.</i> (M, K, TA.)
― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدٌ</span>, (tropical:)  <i>He</i> (a youth) <i>was,</i> or
<i>became, soft, tender,</i> or <i>delicate.</i> (T, S, L.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدٌ</span>, below. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَلَدَهُ</span> <i>He drew</i> or <i>pulled
it; strained it;</i> or <i>extended</i> or <i>stretched it;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدَّهُ</span>. (K.)

